\title "Waltz strum (3/4)"
\subtitle "Ukulele, all open strings (C major), 3-beat bar"
\copyright "Pattern under MIT or Apache-2.0."
\tempo 120
\tuning A4 E4 C4 G4
.
// Three-beat waltz: a single down on beat 1, then a down-up
// figure on beats 2 and 3. Same C-major-open chord shape as the
// other uke strums — this drill is purely about feeling 3/4
// after spending all your time in 4/4.
//
// Per-column (1/8 resolution, 6 columns per bar = 3 beats):
//   col 0  D    (beat 1)
//   col 1  rest (and-of-1)
//   col 2  D    (beat 2)
//   col 3  U    (and-of-2)
//   col 4  D    (beat 3)
//   col 5  U    (and-of-3)
:8 (0.1 0.2 0.3 0.4) r (0.1 0.2 0.3 0.4) (0.1 0.2 0.3 0.4) (0.1 0.2 0.3 0.4) (0.1 0.2 0.3 0.4) |
:8 (0.1 0.2 0.3 0.4) r (0.1 0.2 0.3 0.4) (0.1 0.2 0.3 0.4) (0.1 0.2 0.3 0.4) (0.1 0.2 0.3 0.4) |
